      }
    },
    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Town_06Zol_01:FEV_Town_06Zol_01_050:e4968fdd",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_FEV_Town_06Zol_01",
        "key": "FEV_Town_06Zol_01_050",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Town_06Zol_01:FEV_Town_06Zol_01_050:e4968fdd",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Town_06Zol_01:FEV_Town_06Zol_01_050:e4968fdd",
        "jp_sha256": "0974512d5db70113d1e2bb88c9ba311225812fad8eaadf84ce2e83dae51cb8a2",
        "official_en_sha256": "59577a73d98465829ab9f5f3f20e2ead7621d22c74bbd8f33d880329bbcfe311"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "もっと暗い街かと思っていましたが……。\r\nいやはや、皆希望に満ちた\r\n明るい表情をしていますねぇ。",
        "official_en": "I was told this city was devoid of warmth...yet I see nothing but smiles. Ah, I am glad the rumors were untrue.",
        "real_en": "I thought this would be a much gloomier city... But look! Everyone's faces are bright with hope."
      },
      "review": {
