      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "不愛想な人が多いと思うけど\r\nあまり悪く思わないでくれよ。\r\n皆、他人に親切にしている余裕なんてないんだ。",
        "official_en": "People giving you the cold shoulder? Don’t take it personally. With the way things are these days, no one can afford to be warm and welcoming.",
