        "official_en_sha256": "a949ce18225facc7bda8f7f869d746f31d89cdaf3225088bf0c015f48075d684"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "今回の革命の犠牲者は\r\nかなり少なかったらしいね。",
        "official_en": "I heard there weren’t many casualties in this latest uprising.",
        "real_en": null
