        "official_en_sha256": "7f658eb776e1ef54750921978d335da100404986c3bda044b312880521755eaf"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "何言ってんのよ。\r\nシエラ様と結婚したら、あんたが皇后ってことよ？\r\nわかってる？",
        "official_en": "Are you serious? You know that’ll make you the empress, right?",
        "real_en": "What are you saying?\r\nIf you marry Shera-sama, you'll be the empress!\r\nYou do understand that, right?"
      },
