        "official_en_sha256": "cfa3715efc404e2be03220f971d6286c1f135b43dd5cd8355f715fee84b9ac1d"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "反乱軍の連中が動きだしたらしい。\r\n厳戒態勢を敷くぞ。",
        "official_en": "It seems the rebels have made their move. We’ve been put on high alert, effective immediately.",
