        "official_en_sha256": "569272209ede7137030614331db59be3a1e27ff32d1ccd39f47719d316ac6ce1"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "嘘は書かないし、いらぬ誤解は防がないとだけど\r\n情報は人に伝わらないと意味がないの。\r\nだから、伝え方にも一工夫必要よ。",
        "official_en": "Of course I don’t embellish anything or write anything that’s misleading, but what use is information if it doesn’t speak to the audience? You have to rack your brain a little for it to really make a splash.",
        "real_en": "I don't write lies, and I avoid giving the wrong impression. But information is useless if it doesn't reach people, so you have to be clever about how you present it."
      },
