      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "情報は正確に、かつ、大胆に。\r\nジャーナリズムだもの、時には煽りも必要よ。",
        "official_en": "Information that’s sent out needs to be accurate yet bold. It’s journalism; you need a little panache here and there.",
        "real_en": "The information has to be accurate, but bold. It's journalism—you sometimes need to stir people up."
