      "text": {
        "jp": "街に漂っていた重い空気が晴れて良かったわ。\r\n心なしか、空気も美味しい気がするの。\r\nスーハー。スー……。",
        "official_en": "The regime’s oppression hanging over the city was suffocating, but now it’s gone, I can finally breathe easy! In fact, I think I’ll take a deep breath right now...",
        "real_en": "I'm so glad that oppressive atmosphere hanging over the city is gone. Even the air seems to taste better somehow. *Inhale*..."
